<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12636] Full rebalance instead of a historical one</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12636</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Common configuration:&lt;br/&gt;
 1)4 nodes&lt;br/&gt;
 2)3-4 caches&lt;br/&gt;
 3)IGNITE_PDS_WAL_REBALANCE_THRESHOLD=500&lt;br/&gt;
 4)walHistorySize=500&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;5)IGNITE_PDS_MAX_CHECKPOINT_MEMORY_HISTORY_SIZE=500&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Scenario:&lt;br/&gt;
 1)Load a lot of data.&lt;br/&gt;
 2)Start the transaction on some client but DON&apos;T close it.&lt;br/&gt;
 3)Stop the server node.&lt;br/&gt;
 4)Start the server.&lt;br/&gt;
 5)PME should be started&lt;br/&gt;
 6)Kill the client started the transaction&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Expected result:&lt;br/&gt;
 Rebalance is HISTORICAL.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Actual result:&lt;br/&gt;
 Rebalance is full:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
