                            <comment id="17031646" author="maliev" created="Thu, 6 Feb 2020 14:56:47 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;We reproduced the problem and found how to fix that. Long story short, problem can be reproduced when client node stops during PME that triggers rebalance. There is no need to start transaction, that was described above.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Root cause is the logic with GridDhtPreloader.generateAssignments(), we do not need to generateAssignments for client exchange task&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
